  "schema_version": 1.0,
  "name": "The Iron Square",
  "description": "A small city's commercial district. Two story residential buildings screen the player's approach; a strip mall and grocery anchor the enemy's. A refinery and grain elevator straddle the central plaza. The ground isn't flat: a gentle hill on each side and a sunken basin at the central plaza give the city real shape. Combat happens in alleys, between parked cars and fire escapes. Bring short-range weapons and stay indoors.",
